<title>USA: El Paso Energy names investor relations manager.</title>
<headline>El Paso Energy names investor relations manager.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Paso Energy Corp on Wednesday said it named Scott D. Vonderheide to the newly created position of investor relations manager.</p>
<p>He will report to Norma F. Dunn, vice president for investor and public relations.</p>
<p>Vonderheide, 33, joins El Paso from Tenneco Energy.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
